WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.801
-Guys, yesterday we launched
something very cool,

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:04.501
something that's never been done
with a late-night show.

00:00:04.501 --> 00:00:06.868
We took "The Tonight Show"
out of the real world

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:08.834
and brought it into "Fortnite."

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:11.667
Yeah, we partnered up with
Samsung to do this.

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:13.067
We wanted to do it right.

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:15.767
So with the help of Samsung
Galaxy's devices, we created

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:19.467
Rockefeller Center, the 30 Rock
building, our studio, studio 6B,

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.334
and we built it all
in "Fortnite."

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:25.334
It is called "Tonight at the
Rock Powered by Samsung Galaxy."

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:27.701
And the attention to detail is
mind-blowing.

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:30.300
It's like you're right there --
Look. Isn't this wild?

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.334
You can walk around.
You can explore stuff.

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:34.734
But there's also a bunch of
minigames in there you can play.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.601
There's an escape room.
There's a taxi race.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:41.300
You can play them all with the
help of a Galaxy Z Fold4,

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:45.267
Watch5, Buds2 Pro,
and Tab S8 Ultra.

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:47.267
Anyway, I thought it would be
fun to play one of

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.567
the "Fortnite" games
in real life.

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:50.534
So, earlier today I got together
with one of

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:52.968
the most famous gamers
in the world, Bugha.

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:54.934
And we took one of
our "Fortnite" minigames

00:00:54.934 --> 00:00:57.000
into the real world.
Check it out.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.300
-Hey, everybody.
I'm Jimmy Fallon.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.000
I'm here with "Fortnite"
World Cup champion Bugha,

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.968
and we're about to play a game
of giant pong which you can find

00:01:03.968 --> 00:01:06.667
on the new "Tonight Show
Tonight at the Rock" experience

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:09.033
on "Fortnite." But first,
we need some practice.

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:11.968
Let's go. Is that you?
Dorfdad running behind me?

00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:15.000
What are you doing behind me?
Stop doing that.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.267
How do we play giant pong?
-Right on this portal.

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:19.567
-Yep.
-Then we hop on. Boom.

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:22.267
-Alright.
We each get 10 seconds here.

00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:24.367
That's your first shot.

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:27.200
-It happens. It happens.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.601
-Ooh, this one has potential!

00:01:29.601 --> 00:01:31.067
Are you kidding me?

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:34.734
How is that even possible to
just lay on the side of a cup?

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:38.968
Did I get it?
Oh, yeah, powerup!

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:42.067
Galaxy Watch5 GPS powerup.

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:43.400
Alright, I'm going to give you
the win on that.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:46.033
But how about we go play
giant pong in real life?

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:48.234
-Let's do it.
-We are on the roof garden here

00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:50.634
at Rockefeller Center, and Bugha
and I are about to compete

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:52.300
in real life giant pong.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.701
We each have 10 balls.

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:55.501
If you get one in the cup,
it's one point.

00:01:55.501 --> 00:01:58.667
We also created our own
real-life Galaxy powerup ring.

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:00.567
If you get it through there,
it's two points.

00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:02.067
Let's do this.

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:03.834
Bugha, you're up. Are you going
for the cup or the two points?

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:07.100
-I'm going for the cup.
-Okay.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.734
-What?
-I'll show you how to do it.

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:09.801
Like this.

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:15.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.000
Oh! Just like that.

00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:22.968
Ooh, 1-1.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.634
You can miss this one.
Don't worry about it.

00:02:28.634 --> 00:02:29.868
You can relax.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.667
You can relax!

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:34.234
I got to go for two.
I got to go for two.

00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:36.901
-There it is.

00:02:39.801 --> 00:02:41.200
There it is.

00:02:42.133 --> 00:02:44.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.534 --> 00:02:46.133
-Hashtag, help me here.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:47.567
Distract him.
-He's contesting the shot.

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:52.767
-Oh! How?
I can't beat this guy.

00:02:52.767 --> 00:02:55.801
The champion, Bugha!

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:57.701
[ Cheers and applause ]
You're the giant pong champ.

00:02:57.701 --> 00:02:59.167
Congratulations, buddy.
-Thank you.

00:02:59.167 --> 00:03:02.901
-But unfortunately, the only
replay we can show is this one.

00:03:02.901 --> 00:03:05.501
-There it is.

00:03:05.501 --> 00:03:07.067
-There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:07.067 --> 00:03:09.701
My thanks -- It is so cool.

00:03:09.701 --> 00:03:11.234
It's really fun to play.

00:03:11.234 --> 00:03:13.234
My thanks to Samsung,
"Fortnite,"

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:14.701
and Bugha for doing that.

00:03:14.701 --> 00:03:17.267
"Tonight at the Rock
Powered by Samsung Galaxy"

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:20.801
is available now.
Scan this QR code right now.

00:03:20.801 --> 00:03:22.634
I know you've got your phones
on you.

00:03:22.634 --> 00:03:24.667
Or you can go to
tonightshow.com/

00:03:24.667 --> 00:03:26.534
tonightattherock.

00:03:26.534 --> 00:03:27.801
It's really fun, everybody.
Check it out.

